---
// Libre Baskerville posters: a detective novel cover, a printer's specimen, a single Q.
---
<figure class="pw-p" id="libre-baskerville-hound" data-name="The Hound">
  <div class="pw-art lbp-a">
    <span class="lbp-a__moon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    <p class="lbp-a__k">A. Conan Doyle</p>
    <p class="lbp-a__h">The Hound<br /><em>of the</em><br />Baskervilles</p>
    <p class="lbp-a__f">“Mr. Holmes, they were the footprints of a gigantic hound!”</p>
  </div>
</figure>
<figure class="pw-p" id="libre-baskerville-specimen" data-name="Specimen">
  <div class="pw-art lbp-b">
    <p class="lbp-b__h">A Specimen</p>
    <p class="lbp-b__s">by John Baskerville of Birmingham</p>
    <span class="lbp-b__r" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    <p class="lbp-b__l">Quousque tandem abutere, Catilina, patientia nostra?</p>
    <p class="lbp-b__m"><em>Quousque tandem abutere, Catilina, patientia nostra? quamdiu etiam furor iste tuus nos eludet?</em></p>
    <p class="lbp-b__t">Quousque tandem abutere, Catilina, patientia nostra? quamdiu etiam furor iste tuus nos eludet? quem ad finem sese effrenata jactabit audacia?</p>
    <p class="lbp-b__f">MDCCLVII</p>
  </div>
</figure>
<figure class="pw-p" id="libre-baskerville-q" data-name="The Q">
  <div class="pw-art lbp-c">
    <p class="lbp-c__q">Q</p>
    <p class="lbp-c__f">The tail that made Baskerville famous.</p>
  </div>
</figure>
<style>
  .lbp-a { background: linear-gradient(#1a2433, #3a4a52 60%, #6a7268); color: #efe8d6; font-family: 'Libre Baskerville', serif; padding: 9cqi 8cqi; display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
  .lbp-a__moon { position: absolute; right: 12cqi; top: 12cqi; width: 22cqi; height: 22cqi; border-radius: 50%; background: #f0e6c8; box-shadow: 0 0 10cqi #f0e6c866; }
  .lbp-a__k { font-size: 3.4cqi; letter-spacing: 0.3em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .lbp-a__h { margin-top: auto; font-size: 11.4cqi; line-height: 1.02; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.02em; }
  .lbp-a__h em { font-weight: 400; font-size: 0.6em; color: #d4a24a; }
  .lbp-a__f { margin-top: 6cqi; font-size: 3.8cqi; font-style: italic; line-height: 1.45; border-top: 0.3cqi solid #efe8d655; padding-top: 3cqi; }
  .lbp-b { background: #f3efe6; color: #1a1813; font-family: 'Libre Baskerville', serif; padding: 9cqi 8cqi; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2.4cqi; text-align: center; }
  .lbp-b__h { font-size: 12cqi; line-height: 1; letter-spacing: 0.04em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .lbp-b__s { font-size: 3.6cqi; font-style: italic; }
  .lbp-b__r { align-self: center; width: 40cqi; height: 0.8cqi; border-top: 0.3cqi solid; border-bottom: 0.3cqi solid; margin: 2cqi 0; }
  .lbp-b__l { font-size: 6.4cqi; line-height: 1.2; font-weight: 700; color: #2c4a6b; }
  .lbp-b__m { font-size: 4.4cqi; line-height: 1.35; }
  .lbp-b__t { font-size: 3cqi; line-height: 1.5; text-align: justify; hyphens: auto; }
  .lbp-b__f { margin-top: auto; font-size: 3.6cqi; letter-spacing: 0.3em; }
  .lbp-c { background: #2c4a6b; color: #f3efe6; font-family: 'Libre Baskerville', serif; }
  .lbp-c__q { position: absolute; left: 50%; top: 40%; translate: -50% -50%; font-size: 100cqi; line-height: 1; font-style: italic; }
  .lbp-c__f { position: absolute; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 8cqi; text-align: center; font-size: 4cqi; font-style: italic; }
</style>
